      "position": {
        "x": 960.6492278771217,
        "y": 434.24072735015295
      },
      "params": {
        "text": "The \"Partner Vectors\" node turns the source -> target edge list into a partner vector. We are also aggregating partners by type and discarding connections to untyped neurons (*untyped in this dataset effectively means small fragment*).",
        "outline": true
      },
      "size": {
        "width": 624,
        "height": 80
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "n1o_75oic",
      "type": "note.text",
      "position": {
        "x": 1625.6229164118758,
        "y": 285.863519290688
      },
      "params": {
        "text": "\"Similarity Matrix\" takes the  partner vectors (effectively a sparse matrix) and calculates a pairwise similarity score (here: cosine) from it.",
        "outline": true
      },
      "size": {
        "width": 230,
        "height": 120
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "ndr_t3na7",
      "type": "note.text",
      "position": {
        "x": 1951.3803898622712,
        "y": 221.25391140650993
      },
      "params": {
        "text": "Calculate a linkage from the similarity scores, produce 5 clusters from that and visualize the results.",
